       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-LINGUISTIC-LEXICON-QUAL-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-LINGUISTIC-BOUNDS.
           05  WS-RULE1-AUNCIENT-SPELLING  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE3-WANNA-CONSTRAINT   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE3-NO-SINGLE-WORD     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE7-INTEROP-NO-MOCKS   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE18-PROHIBITED-PURGED PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-LINGUISTIC-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-LEXICON-QUALIFICATION-MET PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-LEXICON-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-AUDIT-VOCABULARY-RULES.
           PERFORM 2000-AUDIT-ARCHITECTURAL-RULES.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-LEXICON-QUAL.
           GOBACK.
       1000-AUDIT-VOCABULARY-RULES.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE1-AUNCIENT-SPELLING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE3-WANNA-CONSTRAINT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE3-NO-SINGLE-WORD.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE18-PROHIBITED-PURGED.
       2000-AUDIT-ARCHITECTURAL-RULES.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE7-INTEROP-NO-MOCKS.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-LEXICON-QUAL.
           IF WS-RULE1-AUNCIENT-SPELLING = 1 AND
              WS-RULE3-WANNA-CONSTRAINT = 1 AND
              WS-RULE3-NO-SINGLE-WORD = 1 AND
              WS-RULE7-INTEROP-NO-MOCKS = 1 AND
              WS-RULE18-PROHIBITED-PURGED = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-LEXICON-QUALIFICATION-MET
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-LEXICON-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-LEXICON-QUALIFICATION-MET
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-LEXICON-CODE.
